; With infer_tolerance_from_cost, postings at cost or price widen the
; tolerance of their cost or price currency by min(units tolerance x number,
; 0.5), summed per currency. Without the option every transaction below
; fails.
option "infer_tolerance_from_cost" "TRUE"

2006-01-01 open Assets:Invest "FIFO"
2006-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2006-01-01 open Assets:Traded

2006-01-17 * "Beancount's documented example: two lots add 0.03096"
  Assets:Invest  18.572 VWELX {30.96 USD}
  Assets:Invest  18.572 VWELX {30.96 USD}
  Assets:Cash  -1150.00 USD

2006-01-18 * "A total cost counts per unit once booked"
  Assets:Invest  18.572 VWELX {{574.99 USD}}
  Assets:Cash   -575.00 USD

2006-01-19 * "A price widens its price currency"
  Assets:Traded  18.572 VWELX @ 30.96 USD
  Assets:Cash   -575.00 USD

2006-01-20 * "A sale with an empty cost spec counts each booked lot"
  Assets:Invest  -40.00 VWELX {}
  Assets:Cash   1238.43 USD
